Debug mode highlights a TOML file's header comment, each root key, and each table's whole header, not values or the comments above keys.
== args
--debug
input/a.toml
== file input/a.toml
# Settings.

# The root key.
key = 1
[table.name]
x = 2
== stdout
«# Settings.»

# The root key.
«key» = 1
«[table.name]»
x = 2
== stderr
== exit 0
